A failed or errored phase now blocks only the phases that depend on it, not-applicable and skipped phases no longer block anything except a phase whose change or action job was skipped in learning mode, `huginn run` and `huginn relearn` exit non-zero only for failed, errored or blocked results (not for results blocked only by learning mode), and tests included from nested test case groups keep the child group's `target` and `tags` for targeting and filtering.
